+
+Set `GameRule.duplicate = True` for fixed per-seat draw queues and scheduled
+rounds in four-player evaluation. See [the duplicate contract](docs/DUPLICATE.md)
+for kan, exhaustion, seed, and match rules. This is an opt-in evaluation
+variant, not ordinary riichi.
+
 ### Game Rules and Modes
 
 RiichiEnv separates high-level game flow configuration (Mode) from detailed game mechanics (Rules).
